        "heading": "",
        "subheading": "",
        "text_content": "<p><strong>D1 Milano</strong> and <strong>Stuart Semple</strong> share a fundamental belief: that design should be accessible. This collaboration is built on that idea.</p><p>Combining the structure and clarity of D1 Milano’s approach to watchmaking with Semple’s use of color as something immediate, expressive and open, the result is a piece that sits somewhere between a watch and a piece of artwork.</p>",
