      "settings": {
        "heading": "THE COLLABORATION",
        "subheading": "",
        "text_content": "<p>In most cases, color is applied once the form is defined. Here, it is considered from the beginning.<br/><br/></p><p>Stuart Semple’s work has consistently explored colour as something that should be shared rather than controlled. That thinking is carried into this collaboration, where color is used directly and without restraint.<br/><br/></p><p>D1 Milano translates that approach into a wearable format, keeping the design clear and resolved while allowing the color to take focus.<br/><br/>The smiley face is one of the best known motifs, having appeared in numerous artworks across time. It represents our ability to find inner happiness even when the world around us seems to put pressure on us from every side.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "center",
        "enable_read_more": false,
        "read_more_text": "Show more",
        "show_less_text": "Show less",
        "container_width": "inherit",
        "offset_top_desktop": 40,
