        "heading": "THE WATCH",
        "text_content": "<p>The watch centres on the dial, where a yellow smiley drawn from Stuart Semple’s work slips out of the case and onto the strap, giving the design an expressive quality. The strap carries Semple’s penchant for pink.</p><p> </p><p>The case remains more controlled, providing structure and allowing the color to hold attention. The balance between these elements keeps the watch wearable, while maintaining a strong visual identity.</p>",
