        "text_content": "<p>The box is designed as a piece of art in its own right. Finished in Semple’s signature saturated pink, the colour becomes an artistic encounter before the watch is even seen.<br/><br/>Inside, the lid carries the statement “By wearing this watch you confirm that you are not Anish Kapoor”, printed alongside Semple’s signature. It turns the interior into a legal artwork, referencing his ongoing challenge to the ownership of color. Alongside the watch, a tin of Semple’s Pinkest Pink pigment and a co-branded certification extend the idea beyond the object itself.<br/><br/></p>",
